  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)-AI Multimedia Digital Skills Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the arrival of the novel coronavirus, USADF and LSETF collaborated to conduct a Request for Proposals focused on healthcare services, infection control and sanitation, and PPE production. Ambient Interactive Multimedia Limited is proposing to deliver integrated media content production training to 150 young Nigerians resident in Lagos. The company is proposing to provide trainings in Graphic design &amp; illustrator, Cinematography with video editing, video &amp; audio editing, 2D/3D animations, motion graphics and visual effects and photography.</narrative>
  </description>
